        "date": "2026-11-18T02:03:05Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(setup-align): accept part alignment on verified non-mill machines\n\nReplace the blanket Kind != Mill refusal in setup_align::generation_problem\nwith a per-machine capability matrix matching verified operation kinds on\nLathe, MillTurn, Plasma, WireEdm and SinkerEdm while keeping Waterjet,\nProbe, 5-axis/rotary kinds and tilt refused. Route wire_ruled 4-axis\npicks and sinker_faces electrode derivation through setup_align::pose_in\nand facets_in, add ElectrodeFromFaces::new_in for explicit setup callers\nand pin every machine kind against turned-vs-baked equivalence suites.\n\nFixes #2287",
